{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>美股三大指數低開後個別發展。納斯達克指數早段走勢偏軟。道瓊斯工業平均指數和標準普爾500指數，略為低開後調頭回升。</p><p></p><p>科技股繼續下跌，晶片股輝達、美光科技和閃迪，早段跌約百分之1至2。雲服務公司CoreWeave急挫約半成。</p><p></p><p>收市後將公布業績的太空探索公司SpaceX，跌逾百分之2。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T16:40:38.261575+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T15:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T22:58:00.965440+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T16:37:50.668216+00:00","content_hash":"f4c092e760cabc5557297cddf8893ec84557c721202ba44c10e19c6c6c8044f7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}